# W31h2, c (k10): joins a in stag0201 and goes into dng204b1 with a (matz01, both on the mat).
# (It heals from the L panel at 350 HP on the way to matz01: stag0201's mummies felled W31b's b in run d1.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@420 fail stagechange
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@800
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@800
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@800
log c in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=600
idle until epoch>=@1150
log c done
